  "title": "A Uniform Four-Attack Obstruction for the Order Gadget at M = 4 mod 8",
  "batch_label": "53",
  "kind": "resolution-paper",
  "original_status": "proved",
  "scope": "For every integer M>=20 with M congruent to 4 modulo 8, the full order gadget OG(M) of Definition 15 is infeasible. More strongly, AP-freeness is already incompatible with the four precedence constraints C4={t_13 preceding b_1, t_11 preceding b_2, t_5 preceding b_5, t_10 preceding b_3}.",
